---
// The docs have one look, charcoal with a periwinkle accent: always the dark theme, whatever
// the system or an earlier visit chose. (Starlight's theme picker is removed in ThemeSelect.astro.)
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
